TITLE:: SmearView
summary:: Smear's display
categories:: Libraries>Smear
related:: Classes/Smear, Classes/FxParamView, Classes/FxParamPanel

DESCRIPTION::
What link::Classes/FxParamPanel:: puts at the top of Smear's window. In it, drag up and down for the smear; the wheel for the stretch.

It draws from the object's settings and the replies its meters bring, so it is only live while the window is running; link::Classes/FxParamView:: has the rest.

